   Output: count(*)
   InitPlan 1 (returns $0)  (slice2)
     ->  Finalize Aggregate (actual rows=1 loops=1)
           Output: avg(small_1.a)
           ->  Gather Motion 3:1  (slice3; segments: 3) (actual rows=3 loops=1)
