                       Output: PARTIAL avg(small_1.a)
                       ->  Seq Scan on public.small small_1 (actual rows=340 loops=1)
                             Output: small_1.a, small_1.b
   ->  Gather Motion 3:1  (slice1; segments: 3) (actual rows=3 loops=1)
         Output: (PARTIAL count(*))
         ->  Partial Aggregate (actual rows=1 loops=1)
               Output: PARTIAL count(*)
               ->  Seq Scan on public.small (actual rows=178 loops=1)
                     Output: small.a, small.b
                     Filter: ((small.a)::numeric > $0)
                     Rows Removed by Filter: 162
 Optimizer: Postgres-based planner
 Settings: optimizer = 'off'
 Planning PMU: instructions=N cycles=N
 Execution PMU: instructions=N cycles=N
 Coordinator PMU: instructions=N cycles=N
 Slice 1 PMU: instructions=N cycles=N QEs=3, max instructions=N (segN)
 Slice 3 PMU: instructions=N cycles=N QEs=3, max instructions=N (segN)
